      "farewell": "Wrote and validated `answer_4002635042.preql`:\n\n```\nimport root.Premium as pr;\nimport root.Policy_Amount as pa;\n\nselect\n  pa.Policy.policy_number as policy_number,\n  sum(pa.policy_amount) as total_premium\nwhere pa.policy_amount_identifier in pr.policy_amount_identifier\norder by pa.Policy.policy_number;\n```\n\nResult (policy number, total premium paid):\n- 31003000336: 86000.0\n- 31003000337: 12000.0\n\nThe `Premium` table carries the premium rows (policy_amount_identifier 2,4,6,8,10,12 \u2014 the policy_amount rows with amount_type_code 'Year'), so summing `policy_amount` over that membership set and grouping by the related `Policy.policy_number` gives the total premium per policy.",
